{"lines":[{"id":"s1","text":"Don't wait in silence.|Shout sumimasen."},{"id":"s2","text":"All froze.|Wrong move."},{"id":"s3","text":"One word.|Sumimasen."},{"id":"s4","text":"Hand up.|Say it loud."},{"id":"s5","text":"Sumimasen!|He turns."},{"id":"s6","text":"He shouted—"},{"id":"s7","text":"He rushes off.|We just wait."},{"id":"s8","text":"Beer arrives.|Everyone beams."},{"id":"s9","text":"Waiting is rude.|Shouting is polite."},{"id":"n1","text":"Say sumimasen.|Nice and loud."},{"id":"n2","text":"It's not rude.|It's the system."},{"id":"n3","text":"Hand up.|Voice up."},{"id":"n4","text":"That's Japan first times.|Follow for more."}],"rate":"+8%","voice":"en-US-GuyNeural"}